@dwex
title: 09 - Chain of Three
desc:  Three armies form a circular move A->B->C->A. The k4 phase
       recognises the cycle and all three moves succeed simultaneously.

map {
  Vie LA 0,0
  Boh LA 2,0
  Tyr LA 1,-1
  Vie -- Boh
  Boh -- Tyr
  Tyr -- Vie
}

orders {
  Au A Vie mve Boh
  Au A Boh mve Tyr
  Au A Tyr mve Vie
}
@end
